1. First collect all postings and retractions
2. Then process retractions, ensuring each retraction cancels its target exactly once
3. Finally calculate the totals based on remaining postings

Let me fix the service.py implementation.","tool":"apply_patch","args":{"path":"service.py","old_text":"def balances(events):
